WEBVTT

00:00:01.520 --> 00:00:04.140
Yui-chan, your hair looks good again today!

00:00:04.140 --> 00:00:06.250
Your ribbon is big and cute.

00:00:06.250 --> 00:00:07.490
I know, right?

00:00:07.490 --> 00:00:08.440
<b>Meow</b>

00:00:07.490 --> 00:00:10.280
I uploaded a pic to Meowstagram 
and now my phone's blowing up.

00:00:09.530 --> 00:00:10.480
<b>Meow</b>

00:00:10.280 --> 00:00:11.920
Come on, right?

00:00:11.530 --> 00:00:12.490
<b>Meow</b>

00:00:11.920 --> 00:00:13.420
Gonna drain my battery.

00:00:13.280 --> 00:00:14.070
<b>Meow</b>

00:00:14.640 --> 00:00:18.620
<i>This guy always comments first.</i>

00:00:19.840 --> 00:00:22.120
"The pics you post everyday are so cute!"

00:00:22.120 --> 00:00:24.210
"Do you have anything from a lower angle?"

00:00:24.490 --> 00:00:26.960
<i>What does he mean "low angle"?</i>

00:00:40.360 --> 00:00:42.300
Takanashi-san is so cute today,

00:00:42.300 --> 00:00:44.600
I didn't know what to say for a second.

00:00:45.060 --> 00:00:49.140
I guess this is what it feels 
like to be in front of a dime.

00:00:48.900 --> 00:00:49.650
<b>Dime</b>

00:00:50.240 --> 00:00:52.670
<i>This always happens when Takanashi comes.</i>

00:00:52.670 --> 00:00:54.550
<i>She didn't even come to school...</i>

00:00:54.550 --> 00:00:56.070
<i>And everyone says she's cuter than me!</i>

00:00:56.330 --> 00:00:58.570
<i>You've got to be kidding me!</i>

00:00:59.780 --> 00:01:01.570
<i>I want to go home and play games.</i>

00:02:33.000 --> 00:02:37.510
<b>Episode 5: My Maid Is Everywhere</b>

00:02:37.840 --> 00:02:40.830
<i>Takanashi Misha, I'm going to 
take you down one of these days!</i>

00:02:40.830 --> 00:02:43.430
<i>I just need to make myself even cuter.</i>

00:02:45.600 --> 00:02:47.770
<i>This is where elementary school 
girls get their picture taken,</i>

00:02:47.770 --> 00:02:51.940
<i>a famous spot where you can even get into 
"Charisma Elementary School Magazine."</i>

00:02:52.420 --> 00:02:56.540
<i>If I keep walking around here, I'm sure 
I'll get tons of pics taken of me.</i>

00:03:02.000 --> 00:03:06.330
<i>And I've walked back and forth 100 
times, so now my feet hurt a lot...</i>

00:03:06.920 --> 00:03:09.640
<i>But being popular is 
about guts and endurance.</i>

00:03:09.640 --> 00:03:12.100
You over there, could I get your picture?

00:03:12.580 --> 00:03:13.890
<i>Finally!</i>

00:03:17.210 --> 00:03:18.560
<i>Her again!</i>

00:03:18.560 --> 00:03:20.340
<i>Why does she keep getting in my way?</i>

00:03:20.710 --> 00:03:23.320
Sorry, I'm not really interested.

00:03:24.150 --> 00:03:25.970
<i>And she turned them down!</i>

00:03:26.250 --> 00:03:27.600
<i>I won't forgive her for this...</i>

00:03:29.550 --> 00:03:30.740
Takanashi...

00:03:31.140 --> 00:03:32.350
I challenge you!

00:03:32.590 --> 00:03:33.480
Huh?

00:03:33.480 --> 00:03:35.280
<i>It's a fashonista. She's scary.</i>

00:03:35.280 --> 00:03:36.690
Morikawa-san?

00:03:36.690 --> 00:03:38.020
Huh? You know her?

00:03:38.020 --> 00:03:40.490
She's in our class. 
Her name is Morikawa Yui-san.

00:03:40.490 --> 00:03:43.990
I'm never going to forgive 
you for forgetting me!

00:03:44.480 --> 00:03:45.990
Sorry.

00:03:45.990 --> 00:03:47.870
What do you mean "challenge"?

00:03:48.140 --> 00:03:49.650
Isn't it obvious?

00:03:49.650 --> 00:03:52.120
We're going to see who twinkles more!

00:03:52.610 --> 00:03:55.000
You should go to the 
bathroom if you have to...

00:03:55.000 --> 00:03:57.400
I'm not talking about peeing myself!

00:03:57.400 --> 00:03:58.860
I'm talking about being cute!

00:03:58.860 --> 00:04:02.360
We're going to find out who's 
cuter once and for all!

00:04:02.840 --> 00:04:03.880
<i>What a pain.</i>

00:04:04.410 --> 00:04:07.070
Anyway, you're a lot cuter.

00:04:07.070 --> 00:04:07.760
All done.

00:04:07.980 --> 00:04:08.560
Huh?

00:04:09.800 --> 00:04:11.020
You're making fun of me!

00:04:11.360 --> 00:04:11.980
Huh?

00:04:12.610 --> 00:04:15.970
Misha-chan, I think it's better 
if you accept her challenge.

00:04:15.970 --> 00:04:18.660
She probably won't give up until you do.

00:04:18.660 --> 00:04:20.610
She's in our class, too.

00:04:21.640 --> 00:04:23.320
What a pain...

00:04:24.270 --> 00:04:28.880
<i>I was having a nice time finally 
going shopping with a friend.</i>

00:04:28.880 --> 00:04:30.330
<i>I don't want her to ruin that!</i>

00:04:30.910 --> 00:04:32.710
Fine, I accept.

00:04:33.070 --> 00:04:35.080
And let's finish this fast.

00:04:36.060 --> 00:04:38.210
You should have just said that first.

00:04:38.590 --> 00:04:41.710
I'll watch that challenge.

00:04:44.520 --> 00:04:45.630
That voice...

00:04:45.630 --> 00:04:47.890
And those legs!

00:04:46.470 --> 00:04:47.890
<b>Muscles</b>

00:04:48.600 --> 00:04:50.280
I would expect nothing less from you, Milady.

00:04:50.280 --> 00:04:51.890
You're absolutely correct.

00:04:52.200 --> 00:04:54.770
I never said I'd be here today!

00:04:55.150 --> 00:04:59.090
<i>I just happen to come here 
to give out these balloons...</i>

00:04:59.090 --> 00:05:01.300
I followed you when you left!

00:05:01.300 --> 00:05:04.150
That's not what the voice 
in your head was saying!

00:05:04.490 --> 00:05:05.990
Who's this?

00:05:05.990 --> 00:05:07.800
Misha-chan's maid.

00:05:07.800 --> 00:05:09.160
Maid?!

00:05:09.670 --> 00:05:11.440
You have tons of money?

00:05:11.440 --> 00:05:13.880
You're cute and have tons of money?

00:05:13.880 --> 00:05:15.680
She just follows me around.

00:05:15.680 --> 00:05:19.040
You make it sound like I'm 
some sort of criminal...

00:05:19.370 --> 00:05:20.040
Hmm?

00:05:20.490 --> 00:05:22.300
Give me a balloon!

00:05:23.840 --> 00:05:25.300
I've got a lolita!

00:05:25.920 --> 00:05:29.860
Here's a balloon, along with my LIME 
messenger info and phone number.

00:05:29.860 --> 00:05:31.060
Yeah, a criminal.

00:05:31.560 --> 00:05:34.720
It's not a crime to hand 
over a piece of paper.

00:05:34.720 --> 00:05:37.680
What's up with you, anyway?

00:05:37.680 --> 00:05:40.310
I'm sorry about that, Morikawa-sama.

00:05:40.760 --> 00:05:42.460
I rather I'm out of place to say this,

00:05:42.460 --> 00:05:45.070
but have you thought of the 
rules for this cuteness contest?

00:05:45.370 --> 00:05:47.750
Of course I have.

00:05:47.750 --> 00:05:51.200
Within an hour, and using 
the money we currently have,

00:05:51.640 --> 00:05:54.580
we find the best clothes we can 
from the stores in this area.

00:05:55.040 --> 00:05:57.210
The person who ends up cuter wins.

00:05:57.590 --> 00:05:59.010
The judge will be Washizaki!

00:05:59.010 --> 00:06:00.160
Me?

00:06:00.160 --> 00:06:02.160
Judge us fairly.

00:06:02.160 --> 00:06:03.090
Okay...

00:06:03.550 --> 00:06:05.920
Misha-chan, how much did you bring?

00:06:05.920 --> 00:06:09.860
Um... 12,000 yen, I think.

00:06:09.860 --> 00:06:11.680
12,000 yen?!

00:06:12.100 --> 00:06:13.830
You have tons of money?

00:06:13.830 --> 00:06:16.830
You're cute and have tons of money?

00:06:16.830 --> 00:06:19.780
When I said I was going out 
with a friend, Yasuhiro...

00:06:20.460 --> 00:06:21.650
I see...

00:06:21.650 --> 00:06:23.680
Get something to eat with this.

00:06:26.720 --> 00:06:28.110
So he gave me some money.

00:06:28.110 --> 00:06:30.780
My normal allowance is 2000 yen.

00:06:31.810 --> 00:06:34.870
I-I just got my allowance, too.

00:06:39.160 --> 00:06:45.140
This is a normal allowance for 
someone in second grade, right?

00:06:45.140 --> 00:06:47.860
Yeah, I get about that much, too.

00:06:47.860 --> 00:06:49.890
Are you sure about this challenge?

00:06:49.890 --> 00:06:52.140
Do you want me to limit 
myself to 512 yen, too?

00:06:53.750 --> 00:06:55.080
I don't need your pity!

00:06:55.080 --> 00:06:58.390
I have good clothes on right now.

00:06:58.900 --> 00:07:01.400
You need to start from scratch with that.

00:07:01.400 --> 00:07:04.900
Hooded Sweatshirt

00:07:01.400 --> 00:07:04.900
Cross-body Purse

00:07:01.400 --> 00:07:04.900
Hot pants

00:07:01.400 --> 00:07:04.900
Flats

00:07:01.680 --> 00:07:04.910
It is true the Miss has level 
1 starting equipment on...

00:07:04.650 --> 00:07:08.570
Scrunchie         Hairband            Ribbon

00:07:04.650 --> 00:07:08.570
Denim Skirt                               Knee Socks

00:07:04.910 --> 00:07:08.570
And Morikawa-sama has on level 50 equipment.

00:07:09.600 --> 00:07:14.320
It'll give me a chance to show you how good 
I am when I add 512 yen to this outfit.

00:07:14.620 --> 00:07:19.730
Though, make sure you take into account 
everyone's financial situation when you judge.

00:07:19.730 --> 00:07:21.080
R-Right.

00:07:21.400 --> 00:07:22.720
Very well.

00:07:22.720 --> 00:07:26.480
Then everyone should meet 
here an hour from now?

00:07:26.480 --> 00:07:27.340
That's right!

00:07:27.680 --> 00:07:29.590
<i>And now she's acting like she's in charge.</i>

00:07:29.900 --> 00:07:30.840
Let's go!

00:07:37.340 --> 00:07:40.060
<i>I already have clothes, shoes, and a bag.</i>

00:07:40.060 --> 00:07:42.070
<i>I couldn't handle that with 512 yen, anyway.</i>

00:07:42.070 --> 00:07:44.480
<i>That means there's only one thing...</i>

00:07:46.700 --> 00:07:48.730
This has gotten pretty annoying.

00:07:48.990 --> 00:07:50.990
But it sounds fun, right?

00:07:51.390 --> 00:07:54.620
Well, I was planning on buying 
clothes to begin with.

00:07:55.030 --> 00:07:57.740
It's just, I'm not sure what to buy.

00:07:57.740 --> 00:07:59.120
What does it mean to be cute?

00:08:01.350 --> 00:08:04.050
The shop on the other side 
has more girly clothes,

00:08:04.050 --> 00:08:05.360
which I'd recommend for you.

00:08:05.360 --> 00:08:06.240
Hmm?

00:08:06.240 --> 00:08:07.280
You want to know who I am?

00:08:07.280 --> 00:08:10.130
I'm a passing fashion critic.

00:08:12.450 --> 00:08:13.870
You're not embarrassed?

00:08:13.870 --> 00:08:15.990
That disguise wouldn't take more 
than 0.2 seconds to figure out.

00:08:15.990 --> 00:08:16.890
What?!

00:08:18.190 --> 00:08:19.690
Good work, Milady.

00:08:19.690 --> 00:08:20.480
You've got a good eye.

00:08:20.480 --> 00:08:23.020
I could tell even if I had glass eyes.

00:08:23.690 --> 00:08:27.280
Anyway, that girl's trying 
really hard on this challenge.

00:08:27.280 --> 00:08:31.280
It would be mean to accept 
someone else's help on this.

00:08:31.280 --> 00:08:32.400
Misha-chan!

00:08:32.680 --> 00:08:34.070
Milady!

00:08:33.530 --> 00:08:35.160
<b>So Cool</b>

00:08:35.440 --> 00:08:38.860
This is that sea urchin
game collaboration T-shirt!

00:08:38.860 --> 00:08:39.660
I think I'll get this.

00:08:40.030 --> 00:08:41.500
No!

00:08:42.420 --> 00:08:45.290
Now, the two of you, step forward!

00:08:51.820 --> 00:08:54.640
I wasn't sure what to pair together,

00:08:54.640 --> 00:08:57.090
so I just got one thing instead.

00:08:58.070 --> 00:09:00.600
That doesn't really show any cute skill.

00:09:01.000 --> 00:09:06.870
And now look at all the work I put in 
buying these flowers at a 100-yen store.

00:09:06.870 --> 00:09:09.110
This'll let me win!

00:09:09.440 --> 00:09:10.930
Misha-chan wins!

00:09:10.930 --> 00:09:12.110
What?!

00:09:12.520 --> 00:09:13.480
Why?

00:09:13.480 --> 00:09:15.500
Takanashi just threw on 
some clothes and that's it.

00:09:15.500 --> 00:09:17.310
But they look good on her,

00:09:17.310 --> 00:09:20.490
and yours kind of are too forced...

00:09:22.200 --> 00:09:23.850
Is there something wrong with standing out?

00:09:23.850 --> 00:09:26.900
It's better to have lots of cute things!

00:09:26.900 --> 00:09:27.920
Morikawa-sama.

00:09:29.020 --> 00:09:30.250
Excuse me for this.

00:09:31.880 --> 00:09:34.760
And she commits crimes without a problem.

00:09:35.020 --> 00:09:37.380
What are you doing?!

00:09:38.500 --> 00:09:39.510
Huh?

00:09:40.890 --> 00:09:42.710
She looks a lot nicer now.

00:09:44.570 --> 00:09:48.880
You added so much that it was disorganized.

00:09:48.880 --> 00:09:51.190
You don't know where to focus your attention.

00:09:51.650 --> 00:09:55.250
By taking off your knee socks, your 
eyes naturally go to the upper body.

00:09:55.250 --> 00:09:57.450
Also, people can see 
how nice your legs are.

00:09:57.860 --> 00:10:00.420
Then I took those flowers and 
tied them up in your ribbon,

00:10:00.420 --> 00:10:01.950
and put the remaining flowers on the left.

00:10:02.400 --> 00:10:04.780
I reduced the number of 
bracelet and scrunchie,

00:10:04.780 --> 00:10:06.960
and created a disparity 
between your left and right.

00:10:07.470 --> 00:10:10.200
What do you think, Morikawa-sama?

00:10:12.770 --> 00:10:14.600
It's a lot better now!

00:10:14.600 --> 00:10:17.470
Yeah, it's not as forced now.

00:10:17.470 --> 00:10:31.860
<b>Cute</b>

00:10:17.850 --> 00:10:19.920
In war, you win by numbers.

00:10:19.920 --> 00:10:23.280
It's better to have sheer force on your side.

00:10:23.280 --> 00:10:25.440
However, if you do not attack 
in an orderly fashion,

00:10:25.440 --> 00:10:26.930
your effectiveness will be reduced.

00:10:27.810 --> 00:10:30.470
A commander uses the right 
units in the correct place

00:10:30.470 --> 00:10:31.860
and increases combat effectiveness.

00:10:32.680 --> 00:10:33.860
M...

00:10:33.860 --> 00:10:35.120
Master!

00:10:35.120 --> 00:10:37.240
<i>This is going to be an annoying relationship.</i>

00:10:37.590 --> 00:10:40.360
I was mistaken, Master.

00:10:41.040 --> 00:10:42.680
I had a time where I thought

00:10:42.680 --> 00:10:45.830
increasing the number of frills 
on something made it cuter.

00:10:45.830 --> 00:10:49.120
However, reduction is what's 
important to cuteness.

00:10:49.480 --> 00:10:51.380
What are they talking about?

00:10:51.670 --> 00:10:53.900
Could I take your picture?

00:10:54.880 --> 00:10:57.630
It's "Charisma Elementary School Magazine!"

00:10:58.190 --> 00:10:59.580
Of course!

00:11:00.880 --> 00:11:05.100
"Today I met my Master of Cuteness and 
had the magazine take my picture."

00:11:05.100 --> 00:11:07.770
"I had the happiest day ever!"

00:11:09.040 --> 00:11:11.230
Glad you had fun, Morikawa-san.

00:11:11.230 --> 00:11:11.810
Meow.

00:11:12.840 --> 00:11:14.020
It's Uncle Low-Angle.

00:11:14.470 --> 00:11:15.270
Huh?

00:11:15.580 --> 00:11:18.140
"Congratulations, you're one 
step closer to your dream."

00:11:18.140 --> 00:11:20.900
"Do you have any lower angle pictures?"

00:11:21.520 --> 00:11:24.690
This person really likes my pictures.

00:11:24.690 --> 00:11:27.040
He always comments right away.

00:11:27.270 --> 00:11:29.410
I see. That's pretty cool.

00:11:29.710 --> 00:11:32.120
He's like Yui's number one fan.

00:11:32.120 --> 00:11:34.410
But I wonder what low angle means.

00:11:34.410 --> 00:11:35.430
It's a mystery.

00:11:35.430 --> 00:11:42.210
Morikawa-sama, a low angel is taking 
a picture from below, looking up.

00:11:42.210 --> 00:11:45.430
He's asking you to display the 
contents of your skirt, in this case.

00:11:47.830 --> 00:11:50.360
Disgusting. Block. Block.

00:11:50.360 --> 00:11:51.800
Bye bye, meow.

00:11:50.360 --> 00:11:51.800
<b>Bye bye, meow.</b>

00:11:54.940 --> 00:11:59.320
<b>Another day</b>

00:11:55.940 --> 00:11:58.240
<i>The man who sent dozens of 
underage girls the message,</i>

00:11:58.240 --> 00:12:01.830
<i>"Do you have any lower angle pictures?" on 
the popular social networking service,</i>

00:12:01.830 --> 00:12:06.580
<i>Meowstagram, has been arrested. He is also 
known as "Uncle Low-Angle."</i>

00:12:03.200 --> 00:12:06.580
<b>Uncle Low-Angle Arrested</b>

00:12:06.880 --> 00:12:09.320
I'm happy for you, Morikawa-sama.

00:12:09.320 --> 00:12:11.540
You're only supposed to gaze 
upon and admire young girls.

00:12:11.540 --> 00:12:14.250
It's blasphemy to bug them annoyingly.

00:12:14.250 --> 00:12:16.750
<i>I hope she gets arrested, too...</i>

00:12:16.750 --> 00:12:21.760
<b>Uzamaid!</b>

00:12:21.760 --> 00:12:26.760
<b>Uzamaid!</b>

00:12:31.440 --> 00:12:33.890
The day has finally come.

00:12:34.450 --> 00:12:35.660
Misha-chan.

00:12:36.150 --> 00:12:39.520
<b>Gloom</b>

00:12:36.900 --> 00:12:37.900
Good morning.

00:12:37.900 --> 00:12:39.520
Why do you look like that?!

00:12:39.830 --> 00:12:44.510
They say you'll catch a cold if you drink 
a sink's worth of iced coffee, right?

00:12:44.510 --> 00:12:46.160
I don't think so.

00:12:46.570 --> 00:12:50.780
I'm not very athletic, and so I did 
that cause I wanted to skip this.

00:12:51.440 --> 00:12:54.170
Not only did I not catch a cold, 
but I couldn't sleep at all.

00:12:54.170 --> 00:12:56.420
Darker reason than I thought.

00:12:56.770 --> 00:12:59.380
Oh yeah, is your maid here today?

00:12:59.380 --> 00:13:00.050
Yeah...

00:13:00.430 --> 00:13:01.300
She's over there.

00:13:01.560 --> 00:13:02.920
Misha!

00:13:03.200 --> 00:13:05.840
She's actually blending in 
today, so I didn't notice.

00:13:05.840 --> 00:13:08.430
She's not wearing a maid outfit 
or anything else today, huh?

00:13:10.390 --> 00:13:12.560
<b>Two days ago</b>

00:13:11.120 --> 00:13:12.560
The day after tomorrow 
is my sports tournament.

00:13:13.070 --> 00:13:15.810
You're going to come, even 
if I tell you not to, right?

00:13:16.340 --> 00:13:17.640
So you can come.

00:13:18.860 --> 00:13:21.550
You can come, but only in normal clothes.

00:13:21.550 --> 00:13:22.320
Nothing that stands out!

00:13:22.320 --> 00:13:24.070
And you don't say a word!

00:13:24.360 --> 00:13:26.670
I really practice, though...

00:13:26.670 --> 00:13:28.450
Let's go, Milady!

00:13:28.450 --> 00:13:30.770
Do you want me to add 
"no breathing" to that list?

00:13:30.770 --> 00:13:33.730
I'm not going to listen to you 
anymore if you don't do this.

00:13:33.730 --> 00:13:34.560
What?!

00:13:36.040 --> 00:13:39.420
<i>Please, just stay quiet...</i>

00:13:39.760 --> 00:13:42.850
Misha-chan, the 50-meter 
dash is about to begin.

00:13:42.850 --> 00:13:43.850
Let's go.

00:13:43.850 --> 00:13:44.420
Yeah.

00:13:45.080 --> 00:13:48.430
<i>I've finally gotten used to my classmates.
 I don't want to stand out.</i>

00:13:49.180 --> 00:13:50.660
On your marks...

00:13:53.000 --> 00:13:55.680
<i>So beautiful; so much so that
I can't look away, even from afar.</i>

00:13:56.120 --> 00:13:57.100
Go!

00:14:02.090 --> 00:14:03.070
Huh?

00:14:06.640 --> 00:14:09.820
<i>Was I this slow?</i>

00:14:10.200 --> 00:14:12.450
<i>Was it because I didn't leave the house?</i>

00:14:12.840 --> 00:14:14.680
Misha-chan, good work.

00:14:14.680 --> 00:14:15.950
Yeah, I...

00:14:17.100 --> 00:14:19.210
<i>She looks like she finally found 
someone that understands her!</i>

00:14:19.800 --> 00:14:21.760
Washizaki! Takanashi!

00:14:21.760 --> 00:14:23.840
You've both done well.

00:14:24.250 --> 00:14:26.340
I'll get revenge for you!

00:14:26.690 --> 00:14:28.760
Morale is what's important in fighting!

00:14:28.760 --> 00:14:32.350
Let's all do our best, and 
win it for the red team!

00:14:32.620 --> 00:14:35.100
<i>This is going to be annoying.</i>

00:14:35.400 --> 00:14:36.990
Is the Master here?

00:14:36.990 --> 00:14:37.980
Over there.

00:14:38.810 --> 00:14:39.770
Master—

00:14:41.190 --> 00:14:42.860
Shi—

00:14:42.860 --> 00:14:44.040
Are you okay?

00:14:44.040 --> 00:14:45.900
Let's get you to the 
nurse's office right away.

00:14:46.200 --> 00:14:49.630
It's not a big deal...

00:14:49.630 --> 00:14:51.280
I can run!

00:14:51.280 --> 00:14:52.530
Leave it to me!

00:14:54.320 --> 00:14:56.910
I won't fall for the same trick twice!

00:15:00.240 --> 00:15:02.420
Ow!

00:15:02.870 --> 00:15:04.710
She hurt the same spot...

00:15:04.710 --> 00:15:06.300
That's gotta hurt.

00:15:06.930 --> 00:15:10.100
I want to go on, but I think I'm done.

00:15:10.100 --> 00:15:12.480
Takanashi, I have a request for you.

00:15:12.480 --> 00:15:13.430
Request?

00:15:13.710 --> 00:15:16.680
I want Master to fill in for me.

00:15:16.890 --> 00:15:18.390
Huh? Why?

00:15:18.770 --> 00:15:21.230
The Master knows how to fight.

00:15:21.230 --> 00:15:22.770
The Master can win!

00:15:23.080 --> 00:15:24.460
Who's this "Master"?

00:15:24.460 --> 00:15:27.680
I don't know, but I guess 
someone Takanashi-san knows?

00:15:27.680 --> 00:15:31.030
With Morikawa-san gone, we don't 
have anyone fast for the rely.

00:15:31.220 --> 00:15:35.780
Yeah, Morikawa-san basically is as
strong as ten people put together.

00:15:36.120 --> 00:15:40.160
If we don't have a replacement,
the red team is never going to win.

00:15:40.430 --> 00:15:44.060
<i>And you can't say "no" in Japan...</i>

00:15:43.750 --> 00:15:45.920
<b>Peer Pressure</b>

00:15:46.500 --> 00:15:49.080
Okay, I'll try asking her.

00:15:51.090 --> 00:15:53.640
I heard what happened

00:15:51.100 --> 00:15:52.170
Huh?

00:15:53.640 --> 00:15:55.890
Master, you came!

00:15:57.900 --> 00:15:59.000
You can talk!

00:15:59.000 --> 00:15:59.770
This is a pain!

00:15:59.770 --> 00:16:00.930
Understood

00:16:01.270 --> 00:16:02.320
She's an adult.

00:16:02.320 --> 00:16:03.350
Is that okay?

00:16:03.730 --> 00:16:06.760
Morikawa-san is faster than a normal adult,

00:16:06.760 --> 00:16:07.890
so I'm sure it's okay.

00:16:07.890 --> 00:16:09.360
Not sure this constitutes normal.

00:16:09.860 --> 00:16:13.010
I will accept Morikawa-sama's last will.

00:16:13.010 --> 00:16:14.610
She's not dead!

00:16:15.030 --> 00:16:16.900
Please, Master.

00:16:17.430 --> 00:16:21.370
I can die without any regrets now.

00:16:22.560 --> 00:16:24.080
It's too early to die!

00:16:24.440 --> 00:16:25.720
I can take of this!

00:16:25.720 --> 00:16:26.840
You changed way too fast!

00:16:28.310 --> 00:16:29.580
She's so muscular!

00:16:29.580 --> 00:16:30.430
You're strong!

00:16:30.430 --> 00:16:31.820
I wanna go next!

00:16:31.820 --> 00:16:33.830
<i>She's standing out after all.</i>

00:16:35.160 --> 00:16:36.510
Program #6.

00:16:36.510 --> 00:16:38.390
The second graders will do the ball toss.

00:16:38.640 --> 00:16:40.930
Let's do this, Milady!

00:16:45.820 --> 00:16:46.930
Take that!

00:16:46.930 --> 00:16:47.610
So fast!

00:16:47.970 --> 00:16:49.200
The red team is fast!

00:16:49.200 --> 00:16:50.980
She's throwing like a 
broken pitching machine!

00:16:52.180 --> 00:16:53.740
There's nothing to pick up...

00:16:54.120 --> 00:16:56.490
The red team wins easily.

00:16:57.160 --> 00:16:58.740
Master, you're amazing!

00:16:59.160 --> 00:17:01.120
We don't need Morikawa-san anymore.

00:17:01.480 --> 00:17:03.500
<i>Children can be cruel sometimes.</i>

00:17:03.740 --> 00:17:05.250
Idiot! You're going too far!

00:17:05.510 --> 00:17:09.720
But I can't go easy in order 
to avenge Morikawa-sama.

00:17:09.720 --> 00:17:11.250
Again, she's not dead.

00:17:11.610 --> 00:17:14.650
We've got a complaint from the white team.

00:17:14.650 --> 00:17:15.260
What?

00:17:15.760 --> 00:17:17.140
They say this isn't fair.

00:17:17.430 --> 00:17:18.760
Yeah.

00:17:18.760 --> 00:17:20.760
Well, I'll take a handicap, then.

00:17:21.040 --> 00:17:22.890
Tie up both my hands.

00:17:22.890 --> 00:17:24.140
What?!

00:17:24.590 --> 00:17:28.080
It's true that you need to swing 
both of your arms to run well.

00:17:28.080 --> 00:17:30.150
I guess if we do that, 
it'll be a proper handicap.

00:17:30.820 --> 00:17:34.280
But the next thing Morikawa-san 
would have entered was...

00:17:34.280 --> 00:17:36.650
<b>Tug of war</b>

00:17:37.030 --> 00:17:38.410
Her legs?!

00:17:40.280 --> 00:17:42.540
<b>Relay</b>

00:17:41.350 --> 00:17:42.540
Her mouth?!

00:17:46.740 --> 00:17:49.540
I managed to win somehow by forcing 
myself to breathe through my nose...

00:17:49.950 --> 00:17:50.920
Tsubame!

00:17:50.920 --> 00:17:51.920
Milady!

00:17:52.370 --> 00:17:53.800
Here's a towel.

00:17:54.340 --> 00:17:55.990
Thank you.

00:17:55.990 --> 00:17:57.510
You were great.

00:17:57.510 --> 00:17:59.300
I think more of you now.

00:18:00.040 --> 00:18:02.560
Actually, I've fallen in love with you.

00:18:02.810 --> 00:18:05.810
Oh, Milady!

00:18:08.140 --> 00:18:09.420
Not very adult like.

00:18:09.420 --> 00:18:10.310
She likes me less.

00:18:10.790 --> 00:18:11.640
What do you want to do?

00:18:11.640 --> 00:18:14.140
You want to give her a bigger 
handicap by breaking her neck?

00:18:15.030 --> 00:18:17.570
That would kill me.

00:18:18.120 --> 00:18:21.080
But only the three-legged race is left.

00:18:21.080 --> 00:18:24.080
I can't handle that on my own.

00:18:24.400 --> 00:18:26.770
I see. The three-legged race...

00:18:27.480 --> 00:18:29.740
Three-legged race...

00:18:30.360 --> 00:18:32.710
Morikawa-san's partner was me!

00:18:33.460 --> 00:18:36.640
I'm going to drink a sink's 
worth of iced coffee...

00:18:36.640 --> 00:18:39.330
Misha-chan, that doesn't work.

00:18:39.330 --> 00:18:41.900
Then I'll sprain my ankle with a black cat!

00:18:41.900 --> 00:18:43.470
It's long gone.

00:18:50.820 --> 00:18:52.610
What should I do?

00:18:54.290 --> 00:18:55.920
Then let's go.

00:18:56.520 --> 00:18:57.490
Already?!

00:18:58.020 --> 00:19:00.740
How'd you do that with your hands tied?!

00:19:01.080 --> 00:19:03.740
Nothing's impossible with love.

00:19:04.510 --> 00:19:06.260
Program #19.

00:19:06.260 --> 00:19:08.620
The second graders will 
have a three-legged race.

00:19:09.520 --> 00:19:13.080
We have the red team's pinch hitter

00:19:13.080 --> 00:19:16.740
that's been displaying amazing 
feats here as Class 2's runner.

00:19:17.660 --> 00:19:21.510
What miracle will she create this time?

00:19:21.840 --> 00:19:23.890
<i>She doesn't even know how I feel...</i>

00:19:25.170 --> 00:19:27.260
And they're off...

00:19:27.760 --> 00:19:31.860
Hmm? The pinch hitter isn't 
running as fast as I thought...

00:19:31.860 --> 00:19:33.270
Actually, she's going slow.

00:19:33.630 --> 00:19:34.650
Darn it...

00:19:34.930 --> 00:19:36.000
Run faster!

00:19:36.000 --> 00:19:37.780
Get worked up!

00:19:38.280 --> 00:19:40.150
I really hate to do this,

00:19:40.720 --> 00:19:44.530
but I'll just cling to 
your leg, so you just run.

00:19:44.770 --> 00:19:47.140
Then it wouldn't be a three-legged race.

00:19:47.140 --> 00:19:48.540
It'd be a two-personed two-legged race.

00:19:48.800 --> 00:19:51.660
But I'll come in last again like this...

00:19:52.110 --> 00:19:53.900
That's okay, too.

00:19:53.900 --> 00:19:54.830
Huh?

00:19:55.230 --> 00:20:00.220
I'm going to get one step closer at a time 
to that finish line, running along with you.

00:20:00.600 --> 00:20:02.970
That's something even 
harder to get than victory.

00:20:05.740 --> 00:20:07.160
I don't need that!

00:20:07.160 --> 00:20:08.720
I want victory, instead!

00:20:09.630 --> 00:20:13.310
The pair from Class 1 that 
had been ahead has fallen!

00:20:13.810 --> 00:20:16.360
Luck is on your side, Milady.

00:20:16.360 --> 00:20:16.940
Huh?

00:20:17.570 --> 00:20:18.940
I'll match you.

00:20:19.240 --> 00:20:22.150
You run as fast as you can.

00:20:22.670 --> 00:20:24.950
I've been doing that...

00:20:27.600 --> 00:20:30.040
The pair from Class 1 has 
caught up to Class 2.

00:20:30.740 --> 00:20:32.040
They've fallen too!

00:20:32.040 --> 00:20:33.580
Class 2 is going to...

00:20:33.580 --> 00:20:35.950
They've come in third!

00:20:40.970 --> 00:20:42.590
Good work.

00:20:43.260 --> 00:20:45.340
Here's the third place ribbon.

00:20:59.320 --> 00:21:00.620
<i>This is my first time.</i>

00:21:01.350 --> 00:21:03.110
We have the same one, Milady.

00:21:05.150 --> 00:21:07.760
Are you a spider, or something?!

00:21:07.760 --> 00:21:08.990
I'm throwing this away!

00:21:08.990 --> 00:21:10.200
Hold on.

00:21:12.420 --> 00:21:14.830
That's your speed, huh?

00:21:15.410 --> 00:21:17.210
You trying to call me slow?

00:21:17.890 --> 00:21:21.710
No, I was able to run the same speed as you,

00:21:21.710 --> 00:21:24.130
and I saw what you saw.

00:21:27.040 --> 00:21:31.120
I'm happy I now have more 
information about you!

00:21:31.120 --> 00:21:32.220
Disgusting.

00:21:32.220 --> 00:21:37.480
<b>Red Team</b>

00:21:32.220 --> 00:21:37.480
<b>White Team</b>

00:21:33.390 --> 00:21:37.480
<i>And the white team won anyway.</i>

00:21:38.030 --> 00:21:42.480
<i>I'd feel like I would need to apologize to 
everyone if we won because of her antics.</i>

00:21:42.960 --> 00:21:44.380
<i>I'm glad things worked out this way.</i>

00:21:45.420 --> 00:21:47.140
<i>I don't really want to think about it,</i>

00:21:47.670 --> 00:21:49.620
<i>but I need to work on my stamina.</i>

00:21:49.910 --> 00:21:53.060
It was a nice race, really!

00:21:53.060 --> 00:21:54.800
Look how cool we look, Milady!

00:21:54.800 --> 00:21:57.640
It's paused on the screen!

00:21:57.640 --> 00:22:00.160
Please burn this scene in to your eyes.

00:22:00.160 --> 00:22:01.090
I'm not looking!

00:22:01.710 --> 00:22:05.450
All right, your dad is going to get an 8K TV!

00:22:05.450 --> 00:22:07.980
Stop wasting money, Yasuhiro!
